        text: "Most skincare disappointment doesn't come from a bad product — it comes from the wrong product for your skin type. A rich, ceramide-heavy cream that's perfect for dry skin can trigger breakouts on oily skin. A gel cleanser formulated for oil control can leave dry skin feeling stripped and tight. The fix isn't more products; it's matching what you use to what your skin actually needs.",
