        question: "Should I use the same sunscreen regardless of skin type?",
        answer:
          "Not necessarily. Oily skin generally does better with matte or gel sunscreens, dry skin with hydrating or cream-based formulas, and sensitive skin with mineral (zinc oxide or titanium dioxide) sunscreens.",
