    title: "Skincare Routine for Gym-Goers: Preventing Sweat-Triggered Breakouts",
    excerpt: "A skincare routine built for gym-goers — how to prevent sweat- and friction-triggered breakouts, protect skin during workouts, and recover properly post-session.",
    summary: "Regular exercise is good for skin long-term, but sweat, friction from equipment and headbands, and delayed post-workout cleansing commonly trigger breakouts — the fix is pre- and post-workout skincare habits built around quick cleansing and breathable products.",
